      "content": "it's not just stagnation though. it's like... the soul is gone. i look at what i did two years ago and it was magic, and then i look at today and it's just technicality. no heart. i feel like a fraud every time i play. i'd honestly rather stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
